		(descr "<H1>Color Computer Cartridge, 2.1\" x 1.75\"</H1>\n\n<P>Edge connector with PCB outline for Tandy/TRS-80 Color Computer cartridge slot:\n\n<P><UL>\n<LI>Width is 2.1\"; full width of edge connector without grounding ears.\n<LI>Length is 1.75\"; suitable for a simple ROM cartridge.\n<LI>With mounting holes and keepouts for installation in Program Pak housing.\n</UL>")
